also struggle with being at rest. You mentioned workaholics Anonymous, and I'm wondering, I mean, are they structured the same way that say alcoholics or narcotics anonymous are structured Is there 12 steps that you have to go through the same as in those other organizations? Yeah, they are. I think it is modeled after, you know, they have the 12 steps, the workbooks, they have sponsors. So I'm not a member, but, you know, learning about it from my research, it seems very similar to like AA, for example. What are you working on now? I mean, what are the big questions that you're trying to answer?

